Please note that we are looking for a part-time colleague (15.2 hours per week).Set next to the picturesque Vondelpark, in the heart of the city, the 396-room Amsterdam Marriott is celebrated for its proximity to significant landmarks such as the Rijksmuseum and Van Gogh Museum, exclusive shopping, vibrant nightlife and high-end restaurants. Opened in 1975 as the first Marriott in Europe, the hotel blends a prime location with contemporary interiors, offering an ideal address for exploring Amsterdam. The hotel also features 11 flexible meeting and event spaces with natural daylight, including our Grand Ballroom and studios. Guests can enjoy premium dining at Midtown Grill, one of Amsterdam's top steak restaurants, as well as Bar TWLV, our cosmopolitan bar offering globally inspired dishes, creative cocktails and a day-to-night atmosphere What are your responsibilities?For our Houseman position, we are looking for a part-time colleague (15.2 hours per week) who is a team player and has an eye for detail when it comes to cleanliness. You will be responsible for the cleanliness on a daily basis in the bar, restaurant and floors. You will also be responsible for the transportation of linen, assisting attendants with garbage and trolleys and handle direct requests from the Front Office colleagues. 

